031m-         [:h2 \"How a lease lives and dies\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A holder that has not observed a grantor-authored grant holds nothing. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Once it has, it renews at strictly less than half the granted duration, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"measured against readings on its own tick stream. A renewal is an append that answers ok; \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"any other outcome advances no bound. The holder stops acting at its bound whether or not anything has been heard, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and releases when done, which spares the grantor a full duration of waiting.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The judge keeps a private ledger of live grants and runs a pass at a declared cadence. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Each pass drains its tick cursor (that reading is now, never a clock call), drains the lease-fact cursors, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"answers proposals, classifies every lease by the first cause that holds, reclaims, and only then records. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The record follows the act: an absent :lapsed fact is never evidence of tenure. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A lease is due for reclaim by the first cause that holds, in this order:\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:table.principles-table\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:thead\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-           [:tr\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:th \"Cause\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:th \"Meaning\"]]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:tbody\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-           [:tr\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \":release\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \"The holder said it was done. The reclaim is still the grantor's act; the release just spares everyone a duration of waiting.\"]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-           [:tr\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \":silence\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \"No eligible renewal was observed within duration plus tolerance, over a window the judge actually observed.\"]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-           [:tr\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \":cap\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \"Total tenure passed the grant's maximum. Renewals cannot help: a hostile or wedged holder cannot squat forever.\"]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-           [:tr\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \":policy\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-            [:td \"The grantor's own reason to end it early. A policy may end a lease, but it may not be implemented by declining to count eligible evidence.\"]]]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The four causes are ordered: a lease already pending its reclaim keeps its cause, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"a release wins before the cap, the cap before policy, and silence comes last. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Reclamation is bounded by duration plus tolerance plus cadence plus the cost of the reclaim itself.\"]]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-       [:section#authority.section-dark\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-        [:div.section-inner\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:h2 \"Facts can be forged. Leases cannot.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A lease fact is an unauthenticated map, and anyone who can append to a medium can write one. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"So the security never rests on the fact. It rests on three gates the fact cannot cross by forgery:\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Attribution first: every fact passes through a composition-supplied resolver bound to the medium it was read from, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and only facts the resolver attributes to the right party count. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A forged renewal in the holder's name counts for nothing: silence is measured as though it never arrived. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A forged release establishes nothing, and cannot pre-empt the genuine holder's later one. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"A forged grant seeds no tenure: only the judge's own grants do that.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Registration second: a lease connects to a medium only through an authoritative fact, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"so an attacker's own noisy medium cannot be attached to someone else's lease, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and flooding it manufactures no evidence.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Possession third: a forged :lapsed records nothing, because recording follows a successful reclaim, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and only the possessor can perform the reclaim. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The resource itself is the ground truth: a remote holder learns of a reclaim by observing it, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"not by trusting anyone's broadcast.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"And when the medium breaks its promise, by evicting facts before the judge read them, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"the judge does not guess. The lease's evidence state becomes unknown, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and the judge demands a full clean duration of observation before silence counts again. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Weaker evidence may delay a conclusion. It must never accelerate one.\"]]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-       [:section#uses.section-dark\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-        [:div.section-inner\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:h2 \"Three uses, and the refusals\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The vocabulary is scoped to three sanctioned uses: \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"the pause a reader holds over a forwarder, the lifetime of a served connection, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and the claim an agent leaves on shared work. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"It is deliberately silent about everything else:\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:ul\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:li \"No delegated renewal: a renewal is evidence about its own author. Delegation is a chain of ordinary leases, each with its own judge.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:li \"No transfer between holders: renegotiate instead.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:li \"No absolute time in any fact: durations cross boundaries, moments never do.\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:li \"No access enforcement: the bound bounds attention, not access. A holder needing real exclusion obtains it from the resource, through fencing.\"]]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"Sizing is stated as relations and the values belong to compositions: \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"the granted duration exceeds twice the renewal interval, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"the tolerance covers flight time and clock skew, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"the renewal interval plus one tick period stays below half the duration, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and a medium's retention window exceeds the judge's lag. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The contract, the rationale, and the implementation are on GitHub: \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"https://github.com/sonwh98/datomworld/blob/master/docs/design/dao.lease.md\" :target \"_blank\" :rel \"noopener noreferrer\"} \"dao.lease.md\"] \", \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"https://github.com/sonwh98/datomworld/blob/master/docs/design/dao.lease.rationale.md\" :target \"_blank\" :rel \"noopener noreferrer\"} \"dao.lease.rationale.md\"] \", \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and the implementation under \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"https://github.com/sonwh98/datomworld/tree/master/src/cljc/dao\" :target \"_blank\" :rel \"noopener noreferrer\"} \"src/cljc/dao\"] \".\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"The deeper lineage is written down too. The judge is a garbage collector for claims: \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"it reclaims what a silent holder no longer proves it wants, the way a collector reclaims what the \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"execution log no longer reaches. That unification, where JIT, GC, and this judge become three \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"interpreters of the same stream, is the subject of \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"/blog/unification-of-jit-and-gc.blog\"} \"The Unification of JIT and GC\"] \".\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-         [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"DaoLease pairs with the rest of the stack: \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"/dao-stream.chp\"} \"DaoStream\"] \" carries the facts, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"/dao-space.chp\"} \"DaoSpace\"] \" makes them queryable, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          [:a {:href \"/shibi.chp\"} \"Shibi\"] \" confines untrusted computation, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[031m-          \"and DaoLease decides whose turn it is.\"]]]])} template))\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+        [:section#how.section-dark\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+         [:div.section-inner\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+          [:h2 \"How a lease lives and dies\"]\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+          [:p\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+           \"A holder that has not observed a grantor-authored grant holds nothing. \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+           \"Once it has, it renews at strictly less than half the granted duration, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+           \"measured against readings on its own tick stream. A renewal is an append that answers ok; \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+           \"any other outcome advances no bound. The holder stops acting at its bound whether or not anything has been heard, \"\u001b[0m\n\u001b[032m+           \"and releases when done, which spares the grantor a full durati